usiness_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0O3FAdHUwqSwdue0CEW_jw","review_id":"UQCRTFMrTJqBhGNNJJ8F8Q","date":"2016-06-10T12:13:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9352462291717529,"text_excerpt":"One of the best ice cream place in town. Service is always welcoming and friendly. The ice cream is so delicious. My usual is always the creole cream cheese. I like that flavor because it is not super sweet and tastes delicious. They used to have this lychee flavor that I also like, but it was a special flavor for the holidays. Just a little note, the last time I visited they only accept cash. I am not so sure if that has change yet."},{"business_id":"0O3FAdHUwqSwdue0CEW_jw","review_id":"7muFgs48VH51jDR5IJt9WQ","date":"2013-10-30T16:47:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9352380633354187,"text_excerpt":"Fools got me addicted to ice cream...well, to be honest, i've had that monkey on my back since about elementary, but they are in no way helping me break that chain, but then again, I don't wanna. I love, love, love this place. Its got the vibe of an old soda shop but cutting edge flavors. I can honestly say that they sampler is one of the greatest inventions in recent times. With the sampler, you can choose between 4 or 6 mini-scoops (each scoop will give you 4 spoon fulls of ice cream so they really are not mini) and with the awesome variety available, its the best way to try a variety of flavors. They typically have 20-30 different flavors (Maybe more?), including sorbets and sherbets. ..."},{"business_id":"0O3FAdHUwqSwdue0CEW_jw","review_id":"M8ld3LFQ92FFY0tHazxhoQ","date":"2016-10-04T16:03:37","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9325569272041321,"text_excerpt":"Probably the best ice cream in New Orleans. They have a multitude of flavors to choose from too! From your basic vanilla and chocolate to the crazier concoctions like Lavender Honey or Green Fairy made with absinthe. I like to try to sample atleast one or two flavors I've never tried when I go. My personal favorite has to the the chefs perfect chocolate. It has fresh ground shavings of dark chocolate with a touch of sea salt to bring out the sweetness of the chocolate. The perfect Ying Yang of flavors. If you can't decide which flavor you want, feel free to ask for a sample or 3. Just don't be THAT guy who wants to sample everything in one visit. If you can't quite decide on a flavor, I u..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0O3FAdHUwqSwdue0CEW_jw","photo_id":"Cdwm_EhDpZ1Q_YKTHiVlIw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Cdwm_EhDpZ1Q_YKTHiVlIw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9457683563232422},{"business_id":"0O3FAdHUwqSwdue0CEW_jw","photo_id":"wIFwoxYsIcX2B_A8eKgeeQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/wIFwoxYsIcX2B_A8eKgeeQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.836585521697998},{"business_id":"0O3FAdHUwqSwdue0CEW_jw","photo_id":"hWxdruZh9xvtLd0KJ8ExeA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hWxdruZh9xvtLd0KJ8ExeA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8334462642669678},{"business_id":"0O3FAdHUwqSwdue0CEW_jw","photo_id":"kXL17t6gxx0p7vJse24feQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/kXL17t6gxx0p7vJse24feQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8282060623168945},{"business_id":"0O3FAdHUwqSwdue0CEW_jw","photo_id":"vNTCBrKlPIswYcr7EnsCWg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/vNTCBrKlPIswYcr7EnsCWg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.6673900485038757}]},"notebook_case":null}
